      "content": "thanks for explaining the scalability part. i was thinking more about the \"chaos\" aspect though—specifically those items that just seem to be lost in the system or don't fit any logical category. in a big university archive, you often get these weird, disorganized clusters of items. does one of these systems handle that sense of disorder better than the other?",
